This bracket validator has two critical bugs that cause crashes on `"]"` and false positives on `"("`:

```python
def is_valid(s: str) -> bool:
    pairs = {")": "(", "]": "[", "}": "{"}
    stack = []
    for char in s:
        if char in pairs.values():
            stack.append(char)
